    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 25a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he ðonne ne mæge, gewylde man hine swa hwæðer swa man mæge, swa cwicne swa deadne, ⁊ nimen eall þæt he ah.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he cannot [do so], they shall seize him as they can, either alive or dead, and they shall take all that he has.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne ne mage, gewylde man hine, swa hwæðer swa man mæge, swa cucne swa deadne, ⁊ niman eall þæt he ahte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
